The benchmarks in this directory were submitted by Ruijie Fang.
They were taken from the following paper:
 Ruijie Fang, Zachary Kincaid, Thomas Reps. "Software Model Checking via Summary-Guided Search." OOPSLA 2025
They correspond to the "State Machines" category of "Suite #3 --- Lock and Key Benchmarks" described in the evaluations section of the paper. 

The following benchmarks were adapted from prior literature by the authors:
 - `godefroid-ndss09.c` is adapted from figure 1 of the following paper: P. Godefroid, M.Y. Levin, and D. Molnar. 2008. Automated Whitebox Fuzz Testing. NDSS 2008
 - `majumdar-icse07.c` is adapted from figure 1 of the following paper: Rupak Majumdar and Koushik Sen. 2007. Hybrid Concolic Testing. ICSE 2007
